comments:
@EmmanuelRoux Thanks for the request. Can you describe your use-case for needing the resolved title on each individual `ActivatedRoute`? Given that the browser title is effectively a singleton, what's the use-case for looking at each individually resolved title?

I don't agree with the first two bullet points of your argument but can certainly get behind the third. For me, the third point is a good enough reason to move forward with the change.

P.S. Changing the title strategy should be done by providing your own through DI, not directly modifying the property on the Router. Unfortunately, the property was exposed in order to match the other strategy patterns used. I'll make a note to investigate making all of these private as a breaking change in v15.
